From: Momonga Build <build@momonga.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] fastfetch: add builtin MomongaOS logo

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [MomongaOS-specific branding]

Register the Momonga logo under the MomongaOS os-release ID so Fastfetch
selects it automatically on Momonga systems.

--- a/src/logo/ascii/m/momonga.txt
+++ b/src/logo/ascii/m/momonga.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+$1    ⣀⣀⡀        ⣀⣀⣀
+  ⢠⡟⠁⡔⣹       ⢸⡇⡀⡈⢳
+  ⢻⡄⠠⣇⠻⣄⡤⠤⠦⠶⠤⣄⣼⣠⡅ ⢸
+   ⢳⣬⠋         ⠈⠃⣴⣏⣴ ⢲⠂⢤⣄
+  ⢀⡞⠁  ⣀⡀⠄  ⢀⢀⣀  ⠈⠳⡈⠆⠉ ⠋⠘⡄
+ ⡶⠚   ⢼⣥⣬⡆  ⢰⣧⣤⣷   ⠣⠤⠄   ⢹
+⢸⢋  ⡰⡢⡼⡍⠉⠠⠄⢆⡄⠉⠉⡵⣤⣶⠄ ⡒⠄  ⡉⢻
+⠈⢧⡆ ⠁⠂⠋   ⠈⠃   ⠉⠑⠈ ⠰⡜  ⣀⢉⠏
+  ⠈⣷             ⡀⢸   ⢀⠈⡟
+   ⢿⣠⠇           ⣇⡼  ⢠⢠⠟
+    ⢹⡄           ⣧⣴⣀⡧⠞⠁
+    ⠈⣇⢰⡤⢤⣤⣤⣤⢤⡤⢤⣤⢸⡏⠉
+     ⠙⠚⠁       ⠙⠚⠃
--- a/src/logo/ascii/m.inc
+++ b/src/logo/ascii/m.inc
@@ -5,2 +5,12 @@
 static const FFlogo M[] = {
+    #ifdef FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_MOMONGA
+    // MomongaOS
+    {
+        .names = { "momonga" },
+        .lines = FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_MOMONGA,
+        .colors = {
+            FF_COLOR_FG_BLUE,
+        },
+    },
+    #endif
     #ifdef FASTFETCH_DATATEXT_LOGO_MACARONIOS
